            "actionDate": "2025-03-27",
            "actionTime": "09:18:00",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "Rule provides for consideration of H.J. Res. 24, H.J. Res. 75 and H.R. 1048. The resolution provides for consideration of H.J. Res. 24 and H.J. Res. 75 under a closed rule, and provides for consideration of H.R. 1048 under a structured rule. Also, the resolution provides for one hour of general debate and one motion to recommit on each measure.",
